[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]嘉靖本独有细节[/font][/b]


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]「汉贼」[/color]：卑衍用"汉贼"骂司马懿，体现公孙燕政权以"绍汉"为旗号的政治立场；毛本改"贼将"，删去政治含义[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000]「死战得脱」[/color]：嘉靖本首次被围时卑衍仍拼死突围，形象更为刚烈；毛本改为"无心恋战"，形象较为消极[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000]「胜佯哭」[/color]：在[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "李胜", "cat": "people"}]李胜[/url][/color]探病司马懿场景中，嘉靖本独有"李胜佯装痛哭"的细节，毛本删去[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000]「[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈珪", "cat": "people"}]陈珪[/url][/color]」vs「[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈群", "cat": "people"}]陈群[/url][/color]」[/color]：嘉靖本问计者为"陈珪"，毛本为魏史实人物"陈群"（魏司空）——嘉靖本"陈珪"疑为讹字[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]5.  [color=#000000]「荆州」vs「青州」[/color]：嘉靖本李胜除"荆州"刺史，毛本从正史改为"青州"刺史（正史：《三国志·[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹爽", "cat": "people"}]曹爽[/url][/color]传》明确"青州"）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]6.  [color=#000000]「辽队」旁注[/color]：嘉靖本附音注"坠也名"，毛本直书"辽隧"，无音注[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


